Log Analyzer
📌 Overview

Log Analyzer is a Python-based cybersecurity tool designed to analyze system and application log files to identify suspicious activities, errors, and potential security threats. It helps users monitor log data and detect unusual patterns that may indicate unauthorized access or malicious behavior.

✨ Features
📄 Read and analyze log files.
🔍 Search for suspicious activities and predefined patterns.
🚨 Identify potential security events and error messages.
📊 Generate a summary of analyzed logs.
💾 Display or save analysis results.
🛡️ Support basic security monitoring and troubleshooting.
🛠️ Technologies Used
Python 3
Regular Expressions (re)
File Handling
Log Parsing
